<h1 style="margin-top: 0;">Press releases</h1>

<h2>December 5, 2013: Opus 1.1 released</h2>
Xiph.Org is pleased to announce the release of <a href="//opus-code.org/">Opus 1.1</a> after two years of development.
<a href="2013/Opus_1.1/">(read on)</a></p>

<h2>February 23, 2013: Digital Show &amp; Tell released</h2>
Xiph.Org is pleased to announce that we've completed 
<a href="http://video.xiph.org/vid2.shtml">_Digital
Show & Tell_</a>, our second major video on digital media.
<a href="2013/DSaT/">(read on)</a></p>

